    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d441">

                <pb facs="0979" n="939" xml:id="pg939"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">320.2 AA/5–2852: Telegram</note>
                <head>No. 441<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Lebanon (Minor) to the
                        Department of State</hi><anchor n="1" xml:id="d441-f1"/></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left"><hi rendition="#small-caps">confidential</hi></seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Beirut</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1952-05-28T13:00:00+02:00">May 28, 1952—1 p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1323. Blandford saw Ben-Gurion, Eytan, Comay Jerusalem 26th. Israelis apparently
                    stated they now accept principle of taking full responsibility refugees. When
                    pressed by Blandford for definite date they tentatively suggested Sept 1.
                    Blandford pushed for July 1. Israelis promised consult the several Ministries
                    concerned with problem and inform agency their position next ten days.</p>
                <p>2. Ben-Gurion displayed surprising lack info refugee problem expressing such
                    mistaken beliefs as (a) all refugees in first class camps and living well; (b)
                    problem solving itself as refugees being absorbed into economies of countries of
                    refuge. Blandford pointed out we have 100,000 more refugees than when we
                    started, only one-third living in camps, and at least half million must be moved
                    to other countries before resettlement.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Minor</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d441-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d441-f1-content">
                <p>Identified also as telegram Rapun 289. Repeated to Tel Aviv.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
